    "detailed_description": "Unidentified area &quot;AREA93&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are in the unidentified area &quot;AREA93&quot;<br />\r\nAn isolated situation with no one around<br />\r\nCan you escape?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is something threatening you<br />\r\nThe only way to survive here is to follow the notes someone wrote down.<br />\r\nEscape from this place in the dark night to avoid unidentified creatures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-An enemy that continuously pursues<br />\r\n-The only hint note for escape<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Control movement with the keyboard.<br />\r\n- Find notes and proceed with the game<br />\r\n- Enemies continuously track you<br />\r\n- Run away from enemies and find all notes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnemies can make unpredictable movements. Always check your surroundings before moving<br />\r\nNotes are hidden everywhere. Look carefully to find them.<br />\r\nThe night is too dark. Adapt to limited vision and prepare for crisis.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHope this helps! Good luck surviving AREA93!",
